# Non-disclosure agreement written as document code.
output = ARGV.len() > 0 ? ARGV[0] : "markdown-nda.docx"; let body = """---
title: Mutual Non-Disclosure Agreement
author: Northstar Studio
subject: Confidential information terms
theme: legal
numbering: true
page_numbers: true
---
# Mutual Non-Disclosure Agreement

This agreement is between **Northstar Studio** and **Blue Orchard Labs**. Each party may disclose information marked confidential or reasonably understood to be confidential.

{{clause: 1}} Definition. Confidential Information includes product plans, source code, customer lists, and financial forecasts.
{{clause: 2}} Obligations. The receiving party will protect the information with reasonable care and use it only for evaluating the proposed collaboration.
{{clause: 3}} Exceptions. Information already public, independently developed, or lawfully received from another source is not Confidential Information.

| Term | Period |
| :--- | ---: |
| Confidentiality | 3 years {bg=#EAF2F8} |
| Trade secrets | As long as protected by law |

[^law]: Defined terms follow the parties’ confidentiality schedule.
The parties acknowledge the terms.[^law]

{{sign: Northstar Studio}}
{{sign: Blue Orchard Labs}}
""";
p=_lmcode_ cli="lmoffice docx" install="github:lmctl-ai/lmoffice@latest";
let d=docx.create(${output}); d.markdown(${body}).save();
end _lmcode_
savedsl(p,output+".dslb"); r=system(concat(dsl_cli(p),["--dsl",output+".dslb"]),120000); assert(r.code==0);
